{"ordinal":14419,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452471988229","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Death_094c08c","source":"Dude: Чувак…","target":"Dude: Frate…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14420,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452471988228","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Death_0eef10f","source":"Dude: А я думал, что мы на одной волне…","target":"Dude: Eu credeam că suntem pe aceeași lungime de undă…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14421,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452471988227","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Ears_DontShoot_02be134","source":"Dude: Типа, все видят ухо, а я – пустоту.","target":"Dude: Adică toți văd o ureche, dar eu văd un gol.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14422,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452471988226","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Ears_DontShoot_06b7222","source":"Dude: Как-то потерял её, и теперь как будто кусок меня пропал.","target":"Dude: L-am pierdut cândva și parcă a dispărut o bucată din mine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14423,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452471988225","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Ears_DontShoot_0ebd870","source":"Dude: Там у меня была крутая плага. Такой здоровенный глаз с мегарадужкой.","target":"Dude: Acolo aveam un plug mișto. Un ochi uriaș, cu un iris imens.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14424,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452471988224","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Photo_DontShoot_08136cd","source":"Dude: Но обычно норм, по кайфу.","target":"Dude: Dar de obicei e ok, chiar plăcut.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14425,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452467793927","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Photo_DontShoot_07f4aeb","source":"Dude: В моменты, когда слишком накурен… ой, то есть, устаю, — бывает, прям пугает.","target":"Dude: Când sunt prea fumat… ah, adică prea obosit, uneori mă sperie rău.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14426,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452467793926","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Photo_DontShoot_0c742d8","source":"Dude: Как будто что-то вокруг меня есть, но этого не видно.","target":"Dude: Parcă e ceva în jurul meu, dar nu se vede.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14427,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452467793925","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Photo_DontShoot_048eb40","source":"Dude: Я сам иногда чувствую свою ауру.","target":"Dude: Uneori îmi simt și eu propria aură.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14428,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452467793924","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_DontShoot_07493c5","source":"Dude: Всю жизнь не понимал, зачем они нам, если мы все носим одежду.","target":"Dude: N-am înțeles niciodată la ce ne folosesc, dacă tot purtăm haine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14429,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452467793923","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_DontShoot_077682c","source":"Dude: Подмышки, блин, ягодицы… Только мешают.","target":"Dude: Axilele, naiba, fesele… Doar ne încurcă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14430,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452467793922","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_DontShoot_09c3a0f","source":"Dude: Вот серьёзно, кто-то вообще любит волосы в таких местах?","target":"Dude: Serios acum, chiar îi place cuiva părul în locurile alea?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14431,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452467793921","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_DontShoot_02f4e22","source":"Dude: Ты сам попробуй так как-нибудь походить. Тоже начнёшь чесаться.","target":"Dude: Încearcă și tu să umbli așa o vreme. O să începi să te scarpini.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14432,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452467793920","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_DontShoot_0d56567","source":"Dude: И чё думаешь? Они меня стопанули и спросили: «Почему у вас глаза красные? Ветром, что ли, надуло?» А я им: «Да нет, обкурился...»","target":"Dude: Și ce crezi? M-au oprit și m-au întrebat: „De ce aveți ochii roșii? V-a bătut vântul în față?” Iar eu: „Nu, am fumat iarbă...”","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14433,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452463599622","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_DontShoot_036724c","source":"Dude: Думаю: «Ща, блин, спросят — укуренный, что ли?». Ну, я и решил, что отвечу им: «Hет, ветром надуло».","target":"Dude: Mă gândeam: „Acum or să mă întrebe dacă sunt fumat.” Așa că am hotărât să le spun: „Nu, m-a bătut vântul în față.”","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14434,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452463599621","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_DontShoot_0b1a178","source":"Dude: Кароч, иду по улице и вижу ментов. А я укуренный жёстко.","target":"Dude: Deci mergeam pe stradă și văd polițiști. Iar eu eram fumat rău.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14435,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452463599620","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_DontShoot_02c449f","source":"Dude: И девчонкам нравится, кстати, хехе.","target":"Dude: Și fetelor le place, apropo, hehe.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14436,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452463599619","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_DontShoot_06911d5","source":"Dude: Вообще я себе нравлюсь больше с большими зрачками. Получается, я как тот кот из мульта про зелёного огра – милый-премилый!","target":"Dude: Mie îmi place mai mult cum arăt cu pupilele dilatate. Sunt ca motanul din desenul cu căpcăunul verde: drăguț foc!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14437,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452463599618","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Hands_DontShoot_07b486e","source":"Dude: Вот ты смотришь на руки – а вдруг они не твои? Это уже бэдтрип какой-то…","target":"Dude: Te uiți la mâini și te întrebi: dacă nu sunt ale tale? Ăsta-i deja un trip nasol…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14438,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452463599617","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Hands_DontShoot_0c8aba9","source":"Dude: После этого долго не мог смотреть на них без странных ощущений.","target":"Dude: După asta, multă vreme nu m-am mai putut uita la ele fără să simt ceva ciudat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14439,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452463599616","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Hands_DontShoot_01cadcd","source":"Dude: Типа, я ими всё делаю, но до того трипа даже не думал, какие они вообще.","target":"Dude: Adică fac totul cu ele, dar înainte de tripul ăla nici nu mă gândeam cum arată.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14440,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452459405321","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Hands_DontShoot_0472b1c","source":"Dude: Они такие странные… мои пальцы.","target":"Dude: Sunt atât de ciudate… degetele mele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14441,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452459405320","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Teeth_DontShoot_08460d0","source":"Dude: Прикинь, у тебя во рту торчат кости. Мистика, блин. Я тогда аж боялся рот открыть.","target":"Dude: Imaginează-ți, îți ies oase din gură. Paranormal, frate. Atunci îmi era frică până și să deschid gura.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14442,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452459405319","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Teeth_DontShoot_005efa7","source":"Dude: А потом мне как-то кореш рассказал, что это кость!","target":"Dude: Și apoi un amic mi-a spus că dinții sunt oase!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14443,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452459405318","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Teeth_DontShoot_0f36cc6","source":"Dude: Когда-то думал, что зубы – вообще фигня. Типа, у меня есть, и ладно.","target":"Dude: Cândva credeam că dinții nu-s mare lucru. Îi am și gata.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14444,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452459405317","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Ears_Gun_0e42332","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14445,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452459405316","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Ears_Gun_0c41a3c","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14446,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452459405315","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Ears_Gun_0425901","source":"Dude: Не хочешь услышать, почему было и что произошло?","target":"Dude: Nu vrei să auzi cum era și ce s-a întâmplat?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14447,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452459405314","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Photo_Gun_02651ac","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14448,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452459405313","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Photo_Gun_0268c3c","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14449,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452459405312","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Photo_Gun_00d2349","source":"Dude: Блин, чел, я и без этого иногда стрёмно себя ощущаю. А ты ещё и пугать меня хочешь?","target":"Dude: Frate, și-așa mă simt uneori ciudat. Tu mai vrei să mă și sperii?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14450,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452455211014","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_Gun_0bfedb2","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14451,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452455211013","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_Gun_0dbf34c","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14452,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452455211012","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_Gun_020962d","source":"Dude: Да чё ты? Я не осуждаю, если не сбриваешь. Каждый живёт, как хочет. Я ж просто хочу культурную беседу провести!","target":"Dude: Ce-ai, frate? Nu te judec dacă nu te razi. Fiecare trăiește cum vrea. Eu vreau doar să purtăm o discuție civilizată!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14453,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452455211011","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_Gun_0db7a69","source":"Dude: Да чё ты? Может, так и должно быть у всех? Может, это хорошо для тела, а мы своим прогрессом уходим всё дальше от природы, а?","target":"Dude: Ce-ai, frate? Poate așa ar trebui să fim cu toții. Poate e bine pentru corp, iar cu tot progresul nostru ne îndepărtăm tot mai mult de natură, nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14454,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452455211010","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_Gun_0133e9f","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14455,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452455211009","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_Gun_080897e","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14456,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452455211008","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_Gun_0c362ab","source":"Dude: Да ты погоди, не так всё плохо будет. Угарная история ж!","target":"Dude: Stai așa, n-o să fie chiar atât de rău. E o poveste trăsnită!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14457,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452451016711","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Hands_Gun_040ad1d","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14458,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452451016710","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Hands_Gun_05ab597","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14459,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452451016709","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Hands_Gun_0c4f248","source":"Dude: Ну ты, чел, жёсткий. А, погоди, ты теперь чувствуешь пушку частью себя? Чума, братан!..","target":"Dude: Ești dur, frate. A, stai, acum simți că pușca face parte din tine? Tare, frățioare!..","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14460,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452451016708","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Teeth_Gun_0b76f23","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14461,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452451016707","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Teeth_Gun_0497971","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14462,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452451016706","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Teeth_Gun_0e297d1","source":"Dude: Блин, чел, ты чего? Расслабься, присядь и поболтай со мной ещё!","target":"Dude: Frate, ce-ai pățit? Relaxează-te, stai jos și mai povestește cu mine!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-366.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14463,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452451016705","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Ears_0c5d4c5","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14464,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452451016704","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Ears_08e6baf","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14465,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452446822410","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Ears_0f5d77e","source":"Dude: Почему висит? Да было тоннельное время…","target":"Dude: De ce atârnă? Păi, am avut perioada mea cu tuneluri în urechi…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14466,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452446822409","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Ears_060d599","source":"Dude: ...","target":"Dude: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14467,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452446822408","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Ears_06cf205","source":"Dude: Угу, угу.","target":"Dude: Mhm, mhm.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14468,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452446822407","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Photo_023b7ce","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14469,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452446822406","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Photo_0437496","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14470,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452446822405","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Photo_04826d2","source":"Dude: Чё, как там моя аура? Яркая? Ха, ну, я так и знал.","target":"Dude: Ei, cum arată aura mea? Strălucitoare? Ha, știam eu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14471,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452446822404","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Photo_0c9a371","source":"Dude: ...","target":"Dude: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14472,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452446822403","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Photo_0475679","source":"Dude: Да без базара!","target":"Dude: Sigur, frate!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14473,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452446822402","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_0f85cd1","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14474,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452446822401","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_06cffe3","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14475,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452446822400","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_09fedee","source":"Dude: Насекомые не кусают, от холода защищаться не надо. Нафига тогда?","target":"Dude: Nu ne mai înțeapă insectele, nu trebuie să ne apărăm de frig. Atunci la ce bun?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14476,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452442628106","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_0d85e66","source":"Dude: Типа, мы уже не в каменном веке.","target":"Dude: Adică nu mai suntem în epoca de piatră.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14477,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452442628105","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_0ded5b0","source":"Dude: Чел, ты только скажи – зачем нам вообще подмышечные волосы?","target":"Dude: Frate, spune-mi doar: la ce ne mai trebuie părul de la subraț?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14478,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452442628104","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_0493c4a","source":"Dude: Бритые, как у младенца! Ну, почти.","target":"Dude: Rase, ca ale unui bebeluș! Ei, aproape.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14479,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452442628103","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_0b27099","source":"Dude: Они, блин, чешутся постоянно. Мне говорили, что это из-за того, что я одежду не стираю. Но это же естественно — так ходить, а!","target":"Dude: Mă mănâncă mereu, naiba. Mi s-a spus că e pentru că nu-mi spăl hainele. Dar e firesc să umbli așa, nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14480,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452442628102","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_06a9d2e","source":"Dude: ...","target":"Dude: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14481,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452442628101","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Armpit_0a8042d","source":"Dude: Ок, ща, погодь, надо, это… небольшой стриптиз сделать, и покажу.","target":"Dude: Bine, stai puțin, trebuie să fac un mic striptease și-ți arăt.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14482,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452442628100","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_0784337","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14483,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452442628099","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_06c8e52","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14484,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452442628098","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_0c627ba","source":"Dude: Я тебе такой прикол расскажу, ты охереешь.","target":"Dude: Îți spun una de o să rămâi mască.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14485,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452442628097","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_0b0cab9","source":"Dude: Красные, да? Ха, привык уже. Ты бы знал, сколько раз меня палили из-за этого.","target":"Dude: Roșii, nu? Ha, m-am obișnuit. De-ai ști de câte ori m-au prins din cauza asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14486,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452442628096","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_04e0203","source":"Dude: Зрачки широкие, да? Ха, привык уже. Ты бы знал, сколько раз меня в магазине палили из-за этого.","target":"Dude: Pupile dilatate, nu? Ha, m-am obișnuit. De-ai ști de câte ori m-au prins în magazin din cauza asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14487,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452438433801","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_055371e","source":"Dude: ...","target":"Dude: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14488,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452438433800","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Eyes_038a5f1","source":"Dude: Я так долго не смогу держать их открытыми. Синдром «тяжёлых век», хехе.","target":"Dude: Nu pot să-i țin deschiși prea mult. Sindromul „pleoapelor grele”, hehe.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14489,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452438433799","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Hands_0c8c45c","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14490,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452438433798","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Hands_0a9daa9","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14491,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452438433797","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Hands_00ec006","source":"Dude: Чувак, это был капец, я тогда вообще только и делал, что двигал пальцами и наблюдал за этим всем.","target":"Dude: Frate, a fost nebunie. Atunci nu făceam decât să-mi mișc degetele și să le privesc.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14492,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452438433796","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Hands_002ff75","source":"Dude: Как-то раз… Да блин, укурился я сильно, смотрю на пальцы, и до меня доходит, что это МОИ пальцы!","target":"Dude: Odată… Naiba, eram fumat rău, mă uit la degete și deodată îmi dau seama că sunt degetele MELE!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14493,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452438433795","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Hands_0c1560f","source":"Dude: ...","target":"Dude: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14494,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452438433794","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Hands_06d3faa","source":"Dude: Оба-на!","target":"Dude: Ia uite!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14495,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452438433793","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Hands_076adb3","source":"Dude: Я, это, закладку недавно искал. Соррян за грязь под ногтями.","target":"Dude: Ăă, căutam de curând un pachet ascuns. Scuze pentru murdăria de sub unghii.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14496,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452438433792","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Teeth_0092c15","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14497,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452434239496","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Teeth_0f91d35","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14498,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452434239495","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Teeth_079e6e2","source":"Dude: Прост курю много.","target":"Dude: Doar fumez mult.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14499,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452434239494","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Teeth_0f9c84b","source":"Dude: Как-то открывал ими бутылку – чуть язык не откусил, но зато бахнул пивка.","target":"Dude: Am deschis odată o sticlă cu ei. Era să-mi mușc limba, dar măcar am băut o bere.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14500,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452434239493","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Teeth_0c29ee7","source":"Dude: Но, ты это, не подумай! Они крепкие.","target":"Dude: Dar, auzi, să nu crezi altceva! Sunt rezistenți.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14501,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452434239492","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Teeth_0c1087a","source":"Dude: Зубы такие, как будто всё детство ел одну кукурузу, а не хлопья, а?","target":"Dude: Dinții arată de parcă aș fi mâncat toată copilăria numai porumb pe știulete, nu fulgi de cereale, nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14502,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452434239491","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Teeth_0db00e3","source":"Dude: ...","target":"Dude: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14503,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452434239490","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_Teeth_089adb1","source":"Dude: Ахахах, погнали, браток!","target":"Dude: Ahahaha, hai, frățioare!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
