{"ordinal":14509,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452430045190","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_WannaCheck_05b7f61","source":"Зубы","target":"Dinți","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14510,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452430045189","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Dude_WannaCheck_0aa4aec","source":"Dude: Йоу, чел, да без проблем. Только, чур, без этих… формальностей, а то я такое не люблю.","target":"Dude: Yo, frate, nicio problemă. Doar fără… formalități din alea, nu-mi plac.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-367.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
